# Build-time switches (D18). Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* into the JS bundle.
#
# Which file to put a line in matters. Expo loads `.env` for EVERY build mode
# (release included), and `.env.development` only for debug builds / `expo start`.
# All of these are gitignored; only this example is committed.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEVNET DEMO (S2/S3, T16, T22): put the next line in `apps/mobile/.env.development`.
# Debug builds then watch devnet (the ledger header shows a DEVNET tag); a release
# build never reads that file, so it stays on mainnet with nothing to remember to
# delete. Never put this line in `.env`.
#
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_NETWORK=devnet
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PERSONAL RPC ENDPOINT (optional): put it in `apps/mobile/.env` so every build you
# make uses it first in the failover list (D9). The URL must match the network the
# build is on (a mainnet endpoint in a devnet build answers "no history" and the
# app never fails over). An invalid value is ignored with a warning in logcat.
#
# The URL -- API key included -- is baked into the APK as a plain string. Never
# distribute, attach, or hand to a tester an APK built with a keyed URL; build
# the shareable APK without this line.
#
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=...
